# Text is kept with LF line ends, in the repository and in every checkout, on
# every system: a file that a tool on Windows wrote with CRLF is stored with LF
# when it is added, rather than differing from its last version on every line.
# The inputs that once made a parser fail are bytes, kept as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
/fuzz/regressions/** binary
